	<section_number>24.2-100</section_number>
	<catch_line>Applicability of title</catch_line>
	<text>
		The provisions of this title shall apply to all elections held in this Commonwealth except as is otherwise provided by general law.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 24-176; 1970, c. 462, § 24.1-95; 1980, c. 639; 1993, c. 641.</history>
